Find Bullet before moveit_core.

moveit_py's CMakeLists finds moveit_ros_planning first. ament's flattened
dependency list for moveit_ros_planning does not contain Bullet, so
find_package(moveit_ros_planning) recurses into moveit_core, whose generated
Config.cmake includes ament_cmake_export_targets-extras.cmake *before*
ament_cmake_export_dependencies-extras.cmake. The imported target
moveit_core::moveit_collision_detection_bullet is therefore declared before
Bullet has been found, while its INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES already names
Bullet::BulletCollision. CMake then aborts with:

  The link interface of target "moveit_core::moveit_collision_detection_bullet"
  contains: Bullet::BulletCollision
  but the target was not found.

moveit_kinematics already works around this by finding Bullet up front; do the
same here.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 project(moveit_py)

+find_package(Bullet CONFIG REQUIRED)
+
 find_package(ament_cmake REQUIRED)
 find_package(rclcpp REQUIRED)
 find_package(rclpy REQUIRED)
